{"id": "d7b7d863-095c-4ae8-8897-7aa94d85a629", "slug": "functional-architectural-spaces", "title": "Functional Architectural Spaces", "description": "Functional Architectural UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Functional Architectural Spaces\"\ndescription: \"Functional Architectural UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FCD34D\"\n  secondary: \"#111111\"\n  accent: \"#FBBF24\"\n  background: \"#E8E8E8\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"7px\"\n  control: \"7px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Functional Architectural Spaces\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 7; favorites: 0; remixes: 7.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, dither, navigation, links, effect.\n## Overview\nFunctional Architectural UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nFrameworks Case Studies Expertise Practice Engage 01 PROPOSITION Spaces That Foster Innovation Designing functional environments that amplify your culture and redefine everyday interactions. Tailored, enduring aesthetic…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Spaces That Foster Innovation.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FCD34D, secondary #111111, accent #FBBF24, background #E8E8E8, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Functional Architectural Spaces</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://api.asc11.com/storage/v1/object/public/published-scripts/exports/20260312094006110-d2b3a7bd-ascii-dither-background.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#e8e8e8] text-[#111111] antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#fcd34d] selection:text-[#111111] min-h-screen flex flex-col relative\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Requested Active Mesh Background -->\n    <div data-ascii-dither-bg aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:auto;height:100vh;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Container with Vertical Lines -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto flex flex-col grow border-x border-[#111111]/10 bg-white/30 backdrop-blur-[2px]\">\n\n        <!-- Mini Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#e8e8e8] z-50\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#e8e8e8] z-50\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#e8e8e8] z-50\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#111111]/20 bg-[#e8e8e8] z-50\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-6 md:px-12 md:py-8 w-full border-b border-[#111111]/5\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px);\" id=\"anim-nav\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer group\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 bg-[#111111] rounded-full rounded-tl-none group-hover:scale-95 transition-transform\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 bg-[#111111] rounded-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex gap-10 text-sm font-light tracking-wide text-neutral-600\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors duration-300\">Frameworks</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors duration-300\">Case Studies</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors duration-300\">Expertise</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors duration-300\">Practice</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <button class=\"bg-[#fcd34d] hover:bg-[#fbbf24] text-[#111111] px-6 py-2.5 md:px-8 md:py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-normal transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5\">\n                Engage\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Hero -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 px-6 md:px-12 pt-12 md:pt-20 pb-16 w-full items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Left Content -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-20\">\n                <!-- Numeric Detail -->\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" id=\"anim-01\">\n                    <span>01</span><div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-neutral-300\"></div><span>PROPOSITION</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Masked Reveal H1 -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-6xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl lg:text-[8rem] leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter font-extralight text-[#111111] mb-8 gsap-reveal\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex pb-2\"><span class=\"translate-y-[110%] word inline-block will-change-transform\">Spaces</span></span><br>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex pb-2 lg:-ml-2\"><span class=\"translate-y-[110%] word inline-block will-change-transform\">That Foster</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-flex pb-2\"><span class=\"translate-y-[110%] word inline-block will-change-transform\">Innovation</span></span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 font-extralight max-w-md md:max-w-lg leading-relaxed mb-10\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\" id=\"anim-p\">\n                    Designing functional environments that amplify your culture and redefine everyday interactions. Tailored, enduring aesthetics engineered for forward-thinking pioneers.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Action Buttons -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-12\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\" id=\"anim-btns\">\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#111111] text-white px-6 md:px-8 py-3.5 md:py-4 rounded-full text-xs md:text-sm font-light hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-all group shadow-md shadow-neutral-900/10\">\n                        Start Dialogue\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#111111]/20 hover:border-[#111111] bg-white/50 text-[#111111] px-6 md:px-8 py-3.5 md:py-4 rounded-full text-xs md:text-sm font-light transition-all group\">\n                        View Concepts\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Border Gradient Thumbnails & Logos -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" style=\"opacity: 0;\" id=\"anim-thumbs\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-4 md:gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/80 to-transparent rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-32 bg-[#e8e8e8] overflow-hidden rounded-[7px] cursor-pointer\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662454419716-c4c504728811?w=400&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Detail\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/80 to-transparent rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"w-20 h-24 md:w-28 md:h-32 bg-[#e8e8e8] overflow-hidden rounded-[7px] cursor-pointer relative flex items-center justify-center group\">\n                                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?w=400&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Detail\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Company Logos (Iconify Simple Icons) -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 mt-2 opacity-40 grayscale\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:vercel\" class=\"text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:stripe\" class=\"text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"simple-icons:linear\" class=\"text-5xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Image Area -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative mt-16 lg:mt-0 w-full flex flex-col items-end\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(40px);\" id=\"anim-image\">\n\n                <!-- Numeric Detail -->\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 self-start md:self-end\">\n                    <span>02</span><div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-neutral-300\"></div><span>SHOWCASE</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Premium Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-[95%] sm:w-[85%] lg:w-full max-w-[550px] p-[1px] rounded-tl-[4rem] rounded-tr-xl rounded-bl-xl rounded-br-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white/80 via-white/30 to-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/5\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full aspect-[4/5] bg-neutral-100 rounded-tl-[calc(4rem-1px)] rounded-tr-[calc(0.75rem-1px)] rounded-bl-[calc(0.75rem-1px)] rounded-br-[calc(0.75rem-1px)] overflow-hidden relative group\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464029902023-f42eba355bde?w=1200&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Modern chair\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000 origin-bottom\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Yellow Accent Box -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-6 -left-6 md:-top-10 md:-left-10 w-20 h-20 md:w-28 md:h-28 bg-[#fcd34d] rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg hover:rotate-3 transition-transform duration-500 cursor-pointer\" style=\"animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-4xl text-[#111111] font-light\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Stats Section -->\n        <section class=\"w-full bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-[#111111]/5 px-6 md:px-12 py-12 lg:py-16 mt-8 md:mt-0 z-20 relative\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center\">\n\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-5\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\" id=\"anim-stat-text\">\n                    <!-- Numeric Detail -->\n                    <div class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span>03</span><div class=\"w-6 h-px bg-neutral-300\"></div><span>IMPACT</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-neutral-700 font-extralight leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                        Pioneering spatial design with <span class=\"font-normal text-[#111111]\">innovative materials</span> and precise engineering to construct the next generation of living.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-wrap gap-10 md:gap-16 lg:justify-end\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\" id=\"anim-stats\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#111111]\">40+</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\">Global Hubs</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#111111]\">450+</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\">Concepts Built</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#111111]\">1.2k</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-light uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\">Custom Assets</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Animations -->\n    <script>\n        // Entrance Animations (Non-GSAP parts)\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const easeOut = \"all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\";\n\n            const animateIn = (id, delay) => {\n                const el = document.getElementById(id);\n                if(el) {\n                    el.style.transition = easeOut;\n                    el.style.transitionDelay = delay + 's';\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        el.style.opacity = '1';\n                        el.style.transform = el.style.transform ? el.style.transform.replace(/translate[XY]\\([^)]+\\)/, 'translate(0,0)') : 'none';\n                    }, 50);\n                }\n            };\n\n            animateIn('anim-nav', 0.1);\n            animateIn('anim-01', 0.2);\n            animateIn('anim-p', 0.8);\n            animateIn('anim-btns', 0.9);\n            animateIn('anim-thumbs', 1.0);\n            animateIn('anim-image', 0.5);\n            animateIn('anim-stat-text', 1.1);\n            animateIn('anim-stats', 1.2);\n\n            // GSAP Masked Reveal for H1 Words\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n            gsap.to(\".word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.3,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".gsap-reveal\",\n                    start: \"top 90%\"\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Floating Keyframes inline injection\n        const styleEl = document.createElement('style');\n        styleEl.innerHTML = `@keyframes float { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(2deg); } }`;\n        document.head.appendChild(styleEl);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "functional-architectural-spaces.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/functional-architectural-spaces.jpg", "source_name": "functional-architectural-spaces-DESIGN.md", "views": 129, "forks": 14, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T07:30:42.346209+00:00"}